Z||000006||thomas_l||06-06-2001||01:08 PM||||Check out <A HREF="http://www.refrigerantsales.com" TARGET=_blank>RefrigerantSales.com</A>. You need an EPA license $20 online at <A HREF="http://www.imaca.com" TARGET=_blank>the IMACA website</A>.<P>Just brace up when you see the price of R12: today's quote is $865 for 30-lb cylinder, $325 for a dozen 12-oz cans  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">||||reg||1
