Z||000009||Fformula88||06-06-2001||10:59 PM||||I did the conversion on my Fiero after my parents did it to their Trans Sport.  Both worked fine... no problems.  The stuff leaks out of my Compressor, but the R-12 had before I did the conversion anyway.  It still works, just needs a recharge every spring.||||reg||1
